Package: cofechar
Type: Package
Title: COFECHA and EDT — R Port of the DPL Dendrochronology Program Library
Version: 1.0.0.9013
Date: 2026
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jonathan", "Barichivich", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "barichivich@lsce.ipsl.fr",
           comment = "R translation and xDPL framework, CATES ERC / CNRS-LSCE"))
Description: A faithful R port of two core modules from Holmes'
    Dendrochronology Program Library (DPL): EDT (ring-measurement editing)
    and COFECHA (quality control and crossdating). All internal statistical
    routines — cubic smoothing spline, Burg autoregressive modelling,
    log-transform, normalisation — are translated directly from the original
    Fortran source (Holmes 1982–1994) to ensure numerical equivalence with
    DPL reference output. A dplR integration layer makes all functions
    interoperable with the standard R dendrochronology ecosystem: inputs and
    outputs are dplR rwl data.frames compatible with detrend(), chron(),
    rwl.stats(), and related functions.
